{"id":"99ef92ec-3ead-4f96-b510-f0d89dcd52bf","slug":"the-greatest-trailer-out-jaalen-best-as-muhammad-ali","title":"The Greatest Trailer Out: Jaalen Best as Muhammad Ali","excerpt":"Official trailer for The Greatest — premieres Nov 4, 2026.","body":"<div class=\"key-takeaways\"><ul><li>The trailer for <b>The Greatest</b> dropped October 14, 2026.</li><li>New series premiering Nov 4, 2026 on Prime Video India.</li><li>The Greatest is an intimate exploration of the incomparable life of the boxing champion, humanitarian and global icon.</li><li>All 8 episodes of the limited series arrive on November 4, 2026.</li></ul></div><p>The makers of <b>The Greatest</b> have released the official trailer, unveiled October 14, 2026.</p><p>Jaalen Best stars as Muhammad Ali, with Omari Hardwick, Dana Gourrier, Amin Joseph, Kai Parham, Michael Ealy and Giovanni Ribisi. Ben Watkins created the limited series and serves as showrunner; the executive producers are Watkins, Michael B. Jordan, Shawn Carter and Lonnie Ali.</p>\n\n<youtube>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t18ng23zvnU</youtube>\n<p>For diaspora audiences in the US, the trailer is the first real look at the series ahead of its streaming debut.</p><div class=\"vdc\"><div class=\"vdc-glow\"></div><div class=\"vdc-title\">Film information</div><div class=\"vdc-grid\"><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Series</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Type</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Nov 4, 2026</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Release</div></div></div><div class=\"vdc-cast\"><div class=\"vdc-cast-lbl\">Cast</div><div class=\"cast-strip\"><div class=\"cast-member\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Jaalen_Best.jpg/330px-Jaalen_Best.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=imageinfo&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" alt=\"Jaalen Best\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"><span>Jaalen Best</span></div><div class=\"cast-member\"><img src=\"h